msgid "Yes. The verb deck lists each verb’s three forms, and when you add a word, AI writes its forms in the card’s notes: nominative, genitive and partitive for a noun, and the ma-infinitive, the da-infinitive and the present tense for a verb."
msgstr "Yes. The verb deck lists each verb’s three forms, and when you add a word, AI writes its forms in the card’s notes: nominative, genitive and partitive for a noun, and the ma-infinitive, the da-infinitive and the present tense for a verb."

msgid "Yes. Three of the 33 questions are about the state where you’re registered, so add its 10 questions as well as the 300 general ones."
msgstr "Yes. Three of the 33 questions are about the state where you’re registered, so add its 10 questions as well as the 300 general ones."

msgid "Yes. Whoever makes the cards shares the deck’s join link, and everyone who joins gets each new card as it’s added."
msgstr "Yes. Whoever makes the cards shares the deck’s join link, and everyone who joins gets each new card as it’s added."

msgid "Yes. You can add a deck and learn it for free."
msgstr "Yes. You can add a deck and learn it for free."

msgid "Yes. Your tutor can make a deck and send you its join link. Every card they add after a lesson reaches you, and you keep your own schedule."
msgstr "Yes. Your tutor can make a deck and send you its join link. Every card they add after a lesson reaches you, and you keep your own schedule."

